==Description==
The '''Binary Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained from [[Lunar Overture Event#Lunar Overture Season Pass|Lunar Overture Season]] at Rank 13, which requires {{Pumpkins|4,100}} or {{Robux|3,970}} total.

The '''Binary Nametag''' has black text with purple-to-pink vertical gradient outline, while text is covered by purple clouds, pink lightnings and floating binary numbers.

